{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202660jpyjCEAn1795524487.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中共中央政治局委員、上海市委書記陳吉寧涉嫌嚴重違紀違法，正接受調查。</p><p></p><p>62歲的陳吉寧，曾任清華大學校長，環境保護部部長，2018年出任北京市長，2022年10月出任上海市委書記。</p><p></p><p>根據上海市政府官網，他對上一次出席公開活動，是上周四到中國遠洋海運集團調研。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T13:03:59.841678+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T11:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T16:57:35.141095+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T12:57:21.247628+00:00","content_hash":"5d4a50a55a159bc34b78049dc0e79128460f9d16c33b243d9926f49b244a5ac8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T13:03:59.841678+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}